feat(brand): Settings disclosure, intro notice and app-name guard

- Settings: the version footer now reads "istylegraph for Android vX"
  and adds the disclosure "Unofficial client based on the open-source
  Telegram Android app. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Telegram."
- Intro: page 1 uses the app name and says that the app uses the
  Telegram API and is not affiliated with Telegram (API terms, rule 2.2).
- LocaleController: AppName and AppNameBeta always come from this
  build's resources (org.telegram.myclient.MyClientStrings). Server
  language packs and bundled translations can no longer show "Telegram"
  as the app name.
